# SP-004: An energy-budgeted distillation is not a chosen mass fraction
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100g @ 70C
add v1 ethanol 10g @ 70C
new
add v2 water 100g @ 70C
add v2 ethanol 10g @ 70C
new
new
distil v1 v3 10kJ
distil v2 v4 20kJ
inspect
